			"notes": "Official release of ezbowls\n\n## Additions\n* new: mod icon\n* new: screenshot\n* new: StewStuffDoer.getLastEmptySlot(): retrieve the last available slot to put a new bowl stack into\n---\n\n## Changes\n* change: StewStuffDoer.getValidSlot(): actually find an already existing stack for bowl to go into\n* change: StewStuffDoer.finishUsing(): actually move the bowl from the player's hand into another stack if one is available\n---\n\n## Removed\n* gone: CustomItem: learning resource\n* gone: ExampleMixin: learning resource"
